  "title": "Futu Concludes Largest Retail Investors Event in Hong Kong, Looking into the Future of Smart Investing with 12,000 Participants Leaders from Global Major Stock Exchanges and Investment Experts Share Insights into Global Investment Trends",
  "summary": "Futu Securities International Limited successfully concluded its second Futu Investment Exhibition (\"Futu Expo\") at the Hong Kong Convention and Exhibition Centre from March 21-22, 2025. As the largest retail investors event in Hong Kong, this year the Expo was doubled in size, attracting over 12,000 participants with over 25 investment strategy seminars and workshops.",
